'''Froakie''' (Japanese: '''ケロマツ''' ''Keromatsu'') is a {{ct|Water}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Genetic Apex}} expansion.

