==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Forbidden Light|Froakie|22}} from the {{TCG|Forbidden Light}} expansion.
*This card's {{TCGP|Promo-A}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|BREAKpoint|Froakie|38}} from the {{TCG|BREAKpoint}} expansion.
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Froakie}}.
*'''Flop''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Team Rocket|Magikarp|47}} from the {{TCG|Team Rocket}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Omega Ruby}}.

